  "body": "When you build your own home, you build it differently. Our sellers combined two sections and created the home they always wanted. Private. Warm. Spacious, and with quality in every detail. This is Gulf Harbour living done really, really well. From the granite benchtops and Smeg appliances to the nine-foot stud heights and quality construction, there's plenty here to appreciate. Outside, there's room to host family and friends, unwind in the sunshine or simply enjoy the sense of space and privacy overlooking the former Gulf Harbour golf course with distant sea views towards Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have loved living here, but with retirement village living now calling, the time has come for someone new to enjoy everything this home has to offer.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Private driveway with excellent off-street parking\r\n* Spacious patios and outdoor entertaining areas\r\n* Quality cook's kitchen with granite benchtops and Smeg appliances\r\n* Near-new 70cm oven and rangehood, Grohe tapware and kitchen skylight\r\n* Nine-foot stud height throughout the main living areas and second bedroom\r\n* Three heat pumps, a wood burner and Moisture Master ventilation system\r\n* Electric blinds and central vacuum system\r\n* Italian-tiled bathroom and kitchen floors\r\n* Quality construction: Cavity brick veneer including H3 timber framing, American roof tiles and 6-inch copper gutters\r\n* Plaster-over-brick veneer exterior and Vantage aluminium joinery\r\n* UV protection film on north and west facing windows\r\n* Attic storage and garage cupboards\r\n* Your own private putting green in the backyard\r\n* Security camera system, motion-sensor lighting and monitored alarm\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of coastal living in sought-after Gulf Harbour on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula. With Gulf Harbour Marina, local beaches, cafes, restaurants, excellent schooling including Wentworth College and Primary, and everyday amenities all within easy reach, this is a location that makes lifestyle living easy.\r\n\r\nFrom long lunches on the patio to relaxed evenings enjoying the open outlook, this is a home that brings together space, comfort and thoughtful quality. Come and experience the space, outlook and lifestyle for yourself.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 11th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/QPML\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
